<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-823] Clean up temp files created by hedwig tests</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-823</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-814&quot; title=&quot;clean up temp files that generated by test cases.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;BOOKKEEPER-814&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;BOOKKEEPER-814&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; cleaned up temp files from the bookkeeper tests. This jira is to do the same for hedwig tests (it creates a couple of zookeeper directories).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
