                            <comment id="14594990" author="jiannan" created="Sun, 21 Jun 2015 08:11:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;For hedwig, there is a org.apache.hedwig.util.FileUtils (in hedwig-client) does the same thing. Since org.apache.hedwig.server.persistence.LocalDBPersistenceManager (in hedwig-server) already uses FileUtils, I think we could employ it similarly in the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
